<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Born into Adam, dying we were;</l><l>We had a sickness no one could cure.</l><l>God, His Son sending, old Adam ending;</l><l>He is dead, we are free!</l><l>He is dead, we are free!</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Now we’re rejoicing, standing in grace,</l><l>Oh hallelujah! Sin is erased!</l><l>God, in us flowing, in our hearts growing,</l><l>We are saved in His life!</l><l>We are saved in His life!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
